        "### Loading Data for Debris and Payloads\n",
        "\n",
        "To analyze differences between orbital debris and payloads, we need a dataset that contains both. We will fetch data for active satellites (which are typically payloads) and a separate dataset for debris from CelesTrak, then combine them."
      ]
